spans.s:
ārogyayati (denom. to ārogya),
(1) salutes (personally and directly): ˚yayitvā, ger. Divy 〔259.11〕; MSV 〔i.42.1〕;
(2) sends a greeting to, Ger. lässt grüssen (= caus.): [] Divy 〔129.5〕 and 〔273.25〕 ˚yayati; 〔273.19〕 ˚yaya, impv.; MSV 〔i.42.3〕 ˚yayati;
(3) caus. ārogyāpayati, = (2): Divy 〔128.25〕 ˚paya, impv. (but MSV 〔i.245.14〕, same passage, ˚gyaya).
